<title>JAPAN: M'bishi says its cars to be made by Pininfarina.</title>
<headline>M'bishi says its cars to be made by Pininfarina.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp announced on Tuesday that Industrie Pininfarina SpA of Italy would invest 2 billion yen to produce Mitsubishi compact sports-utility vehicles in Italy.</p>
<p>Pininfarina would produce 35,000 of the vehicles a year for Mitsubishi. They would go on sale in the spring of 1999 through Mitsubishi's European sales network, a Mitsubishi statement said.</p>
